#: filtereditor.cpp:93
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>The unique identifier of this filtering program. It can be any string, as "
"long as it is globally unique. In user applications this will usually be "
"automatically assigned and hidden.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Jedinstveni identifikator ovog programa za filtriranje. To može biti bilo "
"koji niz, dok je globalno jedinstven. U korisničkim aplikacijama ovo će "
"obično biti automatski dodijeljeno i skriveno. </p>"

#: filtereditor.cpp:103
#, kde-format
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Ime"

#: filtereditor.cpp:111
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>The user-visible name of this filtering program. It can be any string: "
"its value will not change the behavior of the filtering agent.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p> Korisniku vidljivo ime ovog programa za filtriranje. To može biti bilo "
"koji niz: njegova vrijednost neće promijeniti ponašanje agenta filtriranja </"
"p>."

# >> @title:column
#: filtereditor.cpp:121
#, kde-format
msgid "Shortcut"
msgstr "Prečica"

#: filtereditor.cpp:133
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>The shortcut for the application of this filter. This is a purely client-"
"side property and the filtering framework will pass it through as-is. In "
"this console it has no useful purpose: it is here only to show that it can "
"be encoded in the filter and preserved.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Prečice za primjenu ovog filtera. Ovo je čisto svojstvo na strani "
"klijenta  i okvir filtriranja će proći kroz kao što jest. U ovoj konzoli "
"nema korisnu svrhu: tu je samo da pokaže da može biti kodiran u filteru i "
"očuvan. </p>"

#: filtereditor.cpp:156
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>The icon associated with this filter. This is a client-side property: it "
"has no effect on the filtering agent, and the filter IO engines pass it "
"through as-is.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ikona je u vezi sa ovim filterom. To je svojstvo na strani klijenta : to "
"nema nikakvog utjecaja na agenta filtriranja, i filter IO motori prolaze "
"kroz kao što su.</p>"

#: filtereditor.cpp:175
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>The collections that this filter is attached to. The filtering agent will "
"push through this filter all the newly arrived items in these collections.</"
"p>"
msgstr ""
"<p> Kolekcija na koju je ovaj filter  priključen. Agent filtriranja će "
"gurnuti kroz ovaj filter sve novopridošle stavke u ovim zbirkama. </p>"

